    "R13-11z": "Land handler statusBits&255:4 prison78,5 hospital55,15 shop50/107; nonzero event skipped for dream. Kind8002/node84 is holding location, not prison visit entrance. No service when merely passing. Empty8-slot native roster returns; normal Web seats come from independent detention roster and skip bankrupt.",
    "R09-02z": "Human UI yes/no validates points>=30 per normal seat (four30 entries; special4 entries300 deferred). 43cf21/43de56 target raw state→128, clear roster bit, keep position and vehicle; own incoming action releases via existing clock. Hostility(target,visitor) -=max(raw&127,1)*100*price, self helper zero. Web records delta, no AI score matrix. No payment callback, insurance, company or bank/public cash. Can help multiple and leave; no charge on cancel or insufficient points.",
    "R07-02z": "Shop hand sale selects card slot or bag tool1..13, count1. 42d145 consumes first matching card and returns card supply; 42d1b2 decrements bag and returns only tool<=8 to finite pool. Equipped vehicle is not bag list447c6e, no implicit dismount. Both constants464364/46436c are IEEE7540.9; points=trunc(points+base*0.9) then word store, not full-price magic/fortune bulk sale. Tools9..13 can sell but are not replenished into shop pool.",
    "R12-02z": "Shop callback accumulates buy return10*base price, sale returnbase price (not seller point credit). On normal human close42ed50 adds sum to company period+28 and cumulative+2c for raw6001..7999. No owner-required check, price multiplier or player cash transfer. v39 enables this close ledger for inherited buying and new selling; existing15th dividend follows after normal day progression.",
    "R13-12z": "Fresh decision token per aid/sale, pause/actor/revision guard, no outside-shop sale. Explicit facility close ends own landing, no date advance while choosing. New last receipts checkpoint with G7. Owner gift branch42e9ea falls through to same shop UI; gift and native random shelf selection remain deferred, not claimed implemented."
